{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Plugin call sites",
                  "field": "callsites",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Components",
                  "field": "components",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Functions",
                  "field": "functions",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files affected",
                  "field": "files_affected",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Install Plug-In steps",
                  "field": "install_plugin_steps",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "components",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Components",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "components"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "components_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "component",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "plugin",
                  "label": "Plugin",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "component",
                  "label": "Component",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "callsites",
                  "label": "Call sites",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "functions",
                  "label": "Functions",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "plugin_dependency",
                  "params": {
                    "component": "{{component}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "top_functions",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Most-used functions"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "top_functions"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "top_functions_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "function_name",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "function_name",
                  "label": "Function"
                },
                {
                  "field": "component",
                  "label": "Component",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "callsites",
                  "label": "Call sites",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "PluginFunction"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "id": "markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Notes\n\nWhich **plugins** the solution depends on, and where. Call sites are read from the resolved `calls_pluginfunction` links (`MBS:<Component>.<Function>`), so the *Most-used functions* list navigates straight into the plugin function's where-used.\n\n- **Components**: call sites, distinct functions and affected files per plugin component. Click a component to filter the function list.\n- **Risk view**: a module built on a component with many call sites is dead without that plugin installed — *Install Plug-In File* steps show where the solution installs plugins itself.\n- **Navigation**: clicking a function opens its plugin-function detail (where-used).\n- **Related rules**: derived severity rules live under *Static Code Analysis*.\n- **Sorting**: all column headings are clickable (▲▼)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
